1
00:00:09,277 --> 00:00:11,927
=The Glory Fades 2=

2
00:00:11,927 --> 00:00:13,798
=Episode 6=

3
00:00:13,798 --> 00:00:14,798
(Sea Breeze Prison)

4
00:00:16,779 --> 00:00:17,860
I'm betting ten thousand yuan!

5
00:00:18,339 --> 00:00:19,339
Come on!

6
00:00:19,899 --> 00:00:20,899
Calm down!

7
00:00:20,979 --> 00:00:22,540
I'll say it one last time.

8
00:00:22,739 --> 00:00:24,540
This is your last chance to place bets!

9
00:00:24,739 --> 00:00:26,979
One to one-point-two for Lion!

10
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:29,379
The dark horse Tu Jiasheng!

11
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:31,100
If he lasts a minute,

12
00:00:31,219 --> 00:00:32,420
one to a hundred!

13
00:00:33,979 --> 00:00:36,539
If he wins, one to a thousand!

14
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:38,900
I'm betting ten thousand yuan!

15
00:00:39,379 --> 00:00:40,699
I'm betting ten thousand yuan!

16
00:00:45,299 --> 00:00:47,060
I bet that Tu Jiasheng

17
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:49,259
won't last a minute!

18
00:00:54,340 --> 00:00:55,619
Here, try this.

19
00:00:56,499 --> 00:00:58,660
It's grown in a village up north.

20
00:00:59,100 --> 00:01:00,499
Guess which one?

21
00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:08,700
Green tea.

22
00:01:16,148 --> 00:01:17,148
Great!

23
00:01:17,356 --> 00:01:18,356
Yeah!

24
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:20,120
Great!

25
00:01:20,659 --> 00:01:21,659
Great!

26
00:01:22,187 --> 00:01:23,187
Way to go!

27
00:01:24,111 --> 00:01:25,111
Great!

28
00:01:29,939 --> 00:01:31,980
He'll be down quite soon.

29
00:01:32,201 --> 00:01:33,928
- Hit him!
- Great!

30
00:01:34,061 --> 00:01:35,061
Great!

31
00:02:02,842 --> 00:02:03,842
Hit him!

32
00:02:08,303 --> 00:02:09,380
- Hit him!
- Come on!

33
00:02:09,459 --> 00:02:10,459
I told you

34
00:02:10,620 --> 00:02:12,060
that he wouldn't last a minute!

35
00:02:17,089 --> 00:02:18,628
I bet on you. Get up!

36
00:02:18,628 --> 00:02:19,637
- Get up!
- Get up!

37
00:02:20,979 --> 00:02:21,979
Get on your feet!

38
00:02:24,495 --> 00:02:25,495
Keep going!

39
00:02:28,260 --> 00:02:29,420
He is really tough!

40
00:02:31,207 --> 00:02:32,318
- Hit him!
- Hit him!

41
00:02:33,964 --> 00:02:34,964
Hit him!

42
00:02:37,010 --> 00:02:38,683
- Keep going!
- Keep going!

43
00:02:42,660 --> 00:02:43,700
Calm down.

44
00:02:46,619 --> 00:02:49,980
Honestly, you have put on the best fight

45
00:02:49,980 --> 00:02:52,179
I've seen since arriving here.

46
00:02:53,299 --> 00:02:54,299
Right?

47
00:02:54,899 --> 00:02:57,028
- Yes.
- Am I right? Speak up!

48
00:02:57,028 --> 00:02:58,449
Yes.

49
00:03:03,220 --> 00:03:04,940
They're worn out.

50
00:03:05,299 --> 00:03:06,700
Let them have a rest,

51
00:03:07,059 --> 00:03:08,059
and have some water.

52
00:03:08,059 --> 00:03:09,459
Once they've rested enough,

53
00:03:10,140 --> 00:03:11,420
keep fighting.

54
00:03:11,509 --> 00:03:13,417
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

55
00:03:15,500 --> 00:03:16,940
You spiked the water, right?

56
00:03:18,859 --> 00:03:20,140
Just a guarantee.

57
00:03:21,299 --> 00:03:23,260
- Dirty tricks.
- I had no choice.

58
00:03:23,299 --> 00:03:24,299
I didn't want to either.

59
00:03:24,420 --> 00:03:25,720
But just like you,

60
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:27,120
he crossed the Nie family.

61
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:40,141
- Hit him!
- Go for it!

62
00:03:40,141 --> 00:03:41,920
- Hit him!
- Don't give up!

63
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:46,600
Hit him!

64
00:03:59,320 --> 00:04:00,320
Get him!

65
00:04:00,640 --> 00:04:01,680
Get him!

66
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:03,040
I don't see any blood yet!

67
00:04:07,768 --> 00:04:09,484
- Hit him!
- Come on!

68
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:14,440
Now this is getting good!

69
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:18,080
- Great!
- Great!

70
00:04:18,080 --> 00:04:19,080
Hit back!

71
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:20,200
Come on!

72
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:21,560
Take him down!

73
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:23,640
- Hit him!
- Come on!

74
00:04:27,337 --> 00:04:28,337
Hit him!

75
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:35,800
Just like that!

76
00:04:36,960 --> 00:04:37,960
Hit him!

77
00:04:41,860 --> 00:04:43,459
You didn't put enough in that water.

78
00:04:47,080 --> 00:04:48,080
Come on!

79
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:49,720
Hit him!

80
00:05:13,260 --> 00:05:15,899
- Great!
- Great!

81
00:05:18,880 --> 00:05:21,760
Great!

82
00:05:22,080 --> 00:05:23,960
Keep going!

83
00:05:23,960 --> 00:05:25,680
- Bring it on!
- Keep going!

84
00:05:30,700 --> 00:05:31,700
Great!

85
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:32,880
Great!

86
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:40,400
Keep going!

87
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:42,000
Come on!

88
00:05:50,400 --> 00:05:51,960
- Great!
- Get him!

89
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:53,680
- Hit him!
- What's happening?

90
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:54,680
Hit him in the face!

91
00:05:56,471 --> 00:05:57,545
Nice hit!

92
00:05:58,341 --> 00:06:00,103
- Hit him!
- Come on!

93
00:06:00,297 --> 00:06:01,297
Keep going!

94
00:06:04,230 --> 00:06:05,740
- Keep hitting him!
- Hit him!

95
00:06:05,740 --> 00:06:07,700
(Thank you for sending
my daughter abroad.)

96
00:06:13,432 --> 00:06:14,432
Hit him!

97
00:06:17,899 --> 00:06:20,464
- Great!
- Awesome!

98
00:06:20,464 --> 00:06:21,501
Awesome!

99
00:06:22,324 --> 00:06:23,596
Awesome!

100
00:06:24,365 --> 00:06:26,447
Great!

101
00:06:26,447 --> 00:06:27,507
What a fight!

102
00:06:27,507 --> 00:06:29,078
Great!

103
00:06:29,078 --> 00:06:30,297
Great hit!

104
00:06:32,242 --> 00:06:34,796
- Yeah!
- Now that's a real fight!

105
00:06:34,796 --> 00:06:36,442
Great!

106
00:06:38,398 --> 00:06:39,398
Good!

107
00:06:39,419 --> 00:06:41,140
The Nie family
has finally met their match.

108
00:07:01,740 --> 00:07:02,740
Is it anesthetic?

109
00:07:05,459 --> 00:07:06,459
I'm allergic to it.

110
00:07:07,339 --> 00:07:08,339
Just stitch it up.

111
00:07:37,620 --> 00:07:38,620
Tell me.

112
00:07:39,099 --> 00:07:40,979
What did you put in Tu Jiasheng's water?

113
00:07:45,579 --> 00:07:46,579
Captain Xia,

114
00:07:47,060 --> 00:07:48,459
I don't know what you mean.

115
00:07:49,620 --> 00:07:50,779
I didn't put anything in it.

116
00:07:51,419 --> 00:07:52,860
It was just regular water.

117
00:07:53,339 --> 00:07:54,500
Besides,

118
00:07:54,740 --> 00:07:55,940
isn't Mr. Tu totally fine?

119
00:08:00,659 --> 00:08:01,700
This bottle is yours.

120
00:08:01,899 --> 00:08:02,940
I swapped it out.

121
00:08:03,539 --> 00:08:05,219
Want me to send it to the lab?

122
00:08:13,700 --> 00:08:14,700
Shui,

123
00:08:22,300 --> 00:08:23,940
you've been well-behaved here.

124
00:08:24,019 --> 00:08:25,979
I was looking into getting
your sentence reduced.

125
00:08:27,060 --> 00:08:28,060
Thank you, Captain Xia.

126
00:08:28,300 --> 00:08:29,300
So,

127
00:08:29,579 --> 00:08:31,459
don't make any mistakes.

128
00:08:31,659 --> 00:08:32,659
One misstep,

129
00:08:32,659 --> 00:08:33,740
and there's no turning back.

130
00:08:34,899 --> 00:08:37,260
Understood.
I won't do anything reckless.

131
00:08:44,179 --> 00:08:45,179
Hit him!

132
00:08:45,387 --> 00:08:47,103
- Hit him!
- Go for it!

133
00:08:48,187 --> 00:08:49,187
- Beat him up!
- Nice hit!

134
00:08:49,899 --> 00:08:50,939
Muscle relaxants.

135
00:08:52,100 --> 00:08:53,260
Phachai made me do it.

136
00:08:54,659 --> 00:08:56,220
He said if I refused,

137
00:08:57,140 --> 00:08:58,299
he'd go after my parents.

138
00:08:58,580 --> 00:08:59,819
I had no other choice,

139
00:08:59,819 --> 00:09:00,819
Captain Xia.

140
00:09:00,860 --> 00:09:01,860
I'll call

141
00:09:01,980 --> 00:09:02,980
Internal Affairs

142
00:09:03,299 --> 00:09:04,740
to have them protect your parents.

143
00:09:05,299 --> 00:09:06,740
But it's no excuse to hurt someone.

144
00:09:07,659 --> 00:09:09,740
I know I was wrong.
I'll never do it again.

145
00:09:12,100 --> 00:09:13,100
Take him to solitary confinement.

146
00:09:13,380 --> 00:09:14,380
Move.

147
00:09:14,860 --> 00:09:15,860
Forget it.

148
00:09:21,899 --> 00:09:22,939
He was forced into it.

149
00:09:26,380 --> 00:09:27,380
Take him back to his cell.

150
00:09:28,500 --> 00:09:29,580
Thank you, Captain Xia.

151
00:09:30,620 --> 00:09:31,620
Thank you, Mr. Tu.

152
00:09:42,019 --> 00:09:43,019
Thank you.

153
00:09:44,460 --> 00:09:45,539
I didn't do it for you.

154
00:09:46,260 --> 00:09:47,539
I just can't stand Phachai's

155
00:09:47,539 --> 00:09:48,980
dirty tricks.

156
00:09:50,460 --> 00:09:52,220
Visible threats are easier
to evade than unseen dangers.

157
00:09:53,100 --> 00:09:54,580
You got lucky this time,

158
00:09:54,939 --> 00:09:55,980
but maybe not next time.

159
00:09:56,580 --> 00:09:57,659
He won't get another chance.

160
00:09:57,899 --> 00:09:58,899
What are you planning?

161
00:09:59,860 --> 00:10:00,860
I'm warning you,

162
00:10:00,860 --> 00:10:02,779
don't cause trouble here.

163
00:10:02,980 --> 00:10:04,260
Could you do me a favor?

164
00:10:04,980 --> 00:10:06,460
Pass a message to someone outside.

165
00:10:07,580 --> 00:10:10,620
- No way.
- You want to know why I came here, huh?

166
00:10:10,699 --> 00:10:12,419
If Phachai takes me out,

167
00:10:12,419 --> 00:10:14,059
you'll never find out.

168
00:10:21,620 --> 00:10:22,620
Feng,

169
00:10:23,380 --> 00:10:24,380
well,

170
00:10:26,340 --> 00:10:27,899
I want to visit Sea Breeze Prison

171
00:10:28,699 --> 00:10:29,699
to see Tu Jiasheng.

172
00:10:33,460 --> 00:10:34,460
You know

173
00:10:35,220 --> 00:10:36,500
that I never went to Prosperity

174
00:10:36,659 --> 00:10:38,740
just to work for him.

175
00:10:38,939 --> 00:10:40,620
I wanted to uncover how my sister died.

176
00:10:40,860 --> 00:10:42,380
Now that he's behind bars,

177
00:10:42,380 --> 00:10:44,659
I want to hear him confess.

178
00:10:44,860 --> 00:10:45,860
I also want to see him

179
00:10:46,140 --> 00:10:47,539
face justice.

180
00:10:53,699 --> 00:10:54,699
Sure.

181
00:10:55,260 --> 00:10:56,340
I'll arrange it.

182
00:10:57,179 --> 00:10:58,179
After all,

183
00:10:59,019 --> 00:11:00,419
watching an enemy fall from grace

184
00:11:01,299 --> 00:11:02,699
is one of greatest pleasures.

185
00:11:03,699 --> 00:11:04,699
Thanks, Feng.

186
00:11:25,179 --> 00:11:26,179
Who are you?

187
00:11:26,699 --> 00:11:27,899
I'm from Sea Breeze.

188
00:11:28,340 --> 00:11:29,740
Someone asked me
to pass along a message.

189
00:11:30,179 --> 00:11:31,380
It's time you pay him a visit.

190
00:11:44,699 --> 00:11:45,699
Tang,

191
00:11:46,299 --> 00:11:48,140
someone is going to see Tu Jiasheng.

192
00:11:48,980 --> 00:11:50,460
I need access to

193
00:11:50,620 --> 00:11:51,860
all the surveillance footage.

194
00:11:58,340 --> 00:12:03,740
♪Su San leaves Hongdong County♪

195
00:12:03,819 --> 00:12:07,500
♪And arrives before the bustling street♪

196
00:12:07,500 --> 00:12:08,834
(Sea Breeze Prison)

197
00:12:59,450 --> 00:13:03,066
♪Streetlights stretch shadows long♪

198
00:13:03,436 --> 00:13:07,421
♪As crowds fade,
who lingers on the edge♪

199
00:13:12,177 --> 00:13:15,496
♪Guarding all those unfinished lies♪

200
00:13:15,496 --> 00:13:20,581
♪Wind sweeps through the empty harbor♪

201
00:13:24,170 --> 00:13:30,722
♪Time quietly strips away the madness♪

202
00:13:30,722 --> 00:13:39,143
♪Plunging all passion
into freezing cold♪

203
00:13:39,143 --> 00:13:42,372
♪The feast ends, leaving only emptiness♪

204
00:13:42,372 --> 00:13:45,567
♪The past drifts far away, unstoppable♪

205
00:13:45,567 --> 00:13:48,260
♪If regret is an inescapable wandering♪

206
00:13:48,260 --> 00:13:52,877
♪I swallow the silence, burning alone♪

207
00:13:56,788 --> 00:13:59,277
♪Burning alone♪

208
00:14:04,783 --> 00:14:11,152
♪The glory fades♪
